  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "品牌設計與行銷企劃",
    "sub_ename": "BRAND DESIGN AND MARKETING PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將藉由個案演練及實務撰寫，訓練學生運用所學理論知識對產業、競爭者、顧客，探討其市場區隔、行銷策略、品牌定位等預測分析，提升學生行銷企劃案撰寫及簡報執行的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to help students learn how to develop and write a comprehensive marketing plan. Students will learn how to integrate the marketing mix in order to build the value proposition associated with the brand positioning. In particular, the course is designed in a way that the knowledge and understanding can be applied in the practical construction of appropriate and realistic marketing plans. Topics to be covered include an analysis of industry, competitor, customer, market potential and forecasting.",
