  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB26119",
    "sub_id": "30974",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1.個案撰寫 : 學期要完成一份神秘作業及三類企畫書作業，讓同學了解不同的企畫書，有不同的要求條件，與各自不同的思考邏輯各類企畫書撰寫內容越完整，分數越高。</div>\n\n<div>2.企劃報告 : 確定同學的提案表達能力，是否符合業界要求。</div>\n\n<div>3.作業需有分工表，無參與工作的同學，該項目分數將以零分計算。</div>\n\n<div>4.曠課一次扣點名分數的十分，曠課超過十週者，點名分數為零分。</div>\n\n<div>5.作業遲交，滿分將以80%計算。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "由於本課程作業需要實務練習，因此有較多的作業與報告，請注意作業、報告的繳交時間。\n本課程採取分組作業，請秉持互惠互助原則，共同分擔作業工作。\n在課堂與同學互動，也請尊重多元文化與性別平權等問題，並請尊重不同立場的政治、宗教態度，切勿有歧視、嘲諷等言行。",
    "course_pol_en": "Since this course requires practical practice, there are many assignments and reports, please pay attention to the submission time of assignments and reports.\nThis course adopts group assignments, please adhere to the principle of mutual assistance and share the homework together.\nWhen interacting with classmates in class, please also respect issues such as multiculturalism and gender equality, and please respect the political and religious attitudes of different positions, and do not discriminate, ridicule and other words and deeds.",
    "course_rem": "如果有任何學習問題，皆可以私下找老師請益喔 !",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>剽竊是對學術信任的嚴重破壞。在學習作業中，我們的言論和想法就是我們作業的價值；因此將他人的作品當作自己的作品繳交，是一種盜竊行為。</div>\n\n<div>作業或報告如需參考他人資料與訊息，或引用他人圖片、使用AI資料，都需要注意著作權問題，請勿任意抄襲或剽竊他人智慧。</div>\n\n<div>拍攝影片時，也請注意影音的版權問題。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Plagiarism is a serious undermining of academic trust. In study assignments, our words and thoughts are the value of our assignments; Therefore, submitting someone else&#39;s work as your own is a form of theft.</div>\n\n<div>If you need to refer to other people&#39;s information and information, or quote other people&#39;s pictures or use AI data, you need to pay attention to copyright issues, and do not arbitrarily plagiarize or plagiarize other people&#39;s wisdom.</div>\n\n<div>When shooting a video, also pay attention to the copyright issues of the video.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
